'''Bore''' (イノシャシ, ''Inoshashi'') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy that appears in [[Into the Future]], [[Cats of the Cosmos]], and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]].

