==Trivia==
*Bore's Japanese name, Inoshashi, may be a combination of 猪 ''inoshishi'' (wild boar) and シャイ ''shai'' (shy).
*In the Korean version, [[Oldhorn]] is named like a variant of Bore. Oldhorn is 고대 보어 ''Godae Bo-eo'' ("Ancient Bore") while Bore is 샤이 보어 ''Syai Bo-eo'' ("Shy Bore").

